<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="justify">This NOTE PURCHASE AGREEMENT (this &#8220;<U>Agreement</U>&#8221;) dated as of September 23, 2026, is entered into by and
