<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="justify">Unless the Agent shall have been notified in writing by a Purchaser prior to the Closing Date that such Purchaser does not
