<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="justify">Section<U></U>&nbsp;2.05 <U>Protective Advances</U>. Notwithstanding any provision of this Agreement and any other Note
