<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="justify">(a) Each Issuer agrees to defend (subject to Indemnitees&#8217; selection of counsel), indemnify, pay and hold
