hold harmless each Indemnitee in the manner set forth in this <U>Section</U><U></U><U>&nbsp;10.01</U>. The Issuers shall not, without the prior written consent of the affected Indemnitee, effect any settlement of any pending or threatened proceeding
against such Indemnitee in respect of which indemnification has been or could have been sought hereunder by such Indemnitee unless such settlement (i)&nbsp;includes an unconditional release of such Indemnitee from all liability or claims that are
