claim or any such damages, whether or not accrued and whether or not known or suspected to exist in its favor; <U>provided</U> that this <U>Section</U><U></U><U>&nbsp;10.01(c)</U> shall not limit the indemnification obligations set forth in
<U>Section</U><U></U><U>&nbsp;10.01(a)</U> or <U>(b)</U>&nbsp;above. </P>
