<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="justify">(e) The Issuers, the Agent and each Purchaser shall, from time to time at the request of the other party
