therein for the benefit of the Agent and Purchasers), is intended to (a)&nbsp;confer any benefits, rights or remedies under or by reason of this Agreement on any Persons other than the express parties to it and their respective permitted successors
and assigns; (b)&nbsp;relieve or discharge the obligation or liability of any Person not an express party to this Agreement; or (c)&nbsp;give any Person not an express party to this Agreement any right of subrogation or action against any Party to
this Agreement. </P>
