<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="justify">Section<U></U>&nbsp;11.23 <U>Judgment Currency</U>. If, for the purposes of obtaining judgment in any court, it is necessary
